<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11190"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 10, 2005 - 2:36 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->yes your are right,  if we go along that line of thinking then we can track him easier, The way he hunted and chose him victims.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11190-->
<!--Post: 11428--><!--Time: 1110695592-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11428"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 12, 2005 - 10:33 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I guess I&#39;m not getting your stalking theories, because your not really doing much hunting if your prey lives 6 doors down the street. &#40;Forgive me Marine&#41;.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11428-->
